{"unit_id":"renger185__dsh-phone-remote#feature-1","repo":"renger185/dsh-phone-remote","commit":"d1756ed5cedabf8d8f746b8cbe459debb8ea7766","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Phone Remote 的功能「会话面板」：按工作区列出 DSH 会话并显示运行状态；点击会话可打开，也可在对应工作区新建会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:190-219"]}
{"unit_id":"renger185__dsh-phone-remote#feature-2","repo":"renger185/dsh-phone-remote","commit":"d1756ed5cedabf8d8f746b8cbe459debb8ea7766","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Phone Remote 的功能「任务通知」：监听会话运行状态和错误事件，在任务结束或出错时向已配置的推送通道发送通知。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:390-433"]}
{"unit_id":"renger185__dsh-phone-remote#feature-3","repo":"renger185/dsh-phone-remote","commit":"d1756ed5cedabf8d8f746b8cbe459debb8ea7766","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Phone Remote 的功能「手机远程入口」：插件生成带登录信息的入口链接并写入文件；配合 companion 代理和临时门，可从手机浏览器访问 DSH。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:350-363"]}
{"unit_id":"renger185__dsh-phone-remote#feature-4","repo":"renger185/dsh-phone-remote","commit":"d1756ed5cedabf8d8f746b8cbe459debb8ea7766","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Phone Remote 的功能「机器人派发」：手机通过企业微信机器人提交文字后，插件将内容交给 DSH 会话处理，并返回本轮回复。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1654-1742"]}
{"unit_id":"renger185__dsh-phone-remote#caveat-1","repo":"renger185/dsh-phone-remote","commit":"d1756ed5cedabf8d8f746b8cbe459debb8ea7766","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Phone Remote 使用前须知：任务完成或报错时，通知会发送到配置的 Webhook；通知内容包含状态信息，部分通知还带远程入口链接（见 index.js:390-433）。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:390-433"]}
